# Maven build hardening — applied to EVERY `mvn`/`mvnw` invocation (CI + local +
# Docker image build), because Maven reads .mvn/maven.config automatically.
#
# Rationale: `dependency:go-offline` downloads the full dependency closure from
# Maven Central in one shot and aborts on the FIRST transient network hiccup
# (observed: "Premature end of Content-Length delimited message body" mid-jar).
# These Wagon HTTP settings make downloads self-heal by retrying, instead of
# failing a 15-minute build over a single dropped TCP stream.
-Dmaven.wagon.http.retryHandler.count=5
-Dmaven.wagon.http.retryHandler.requestSentEnabled=true
-Dmaven.wagon.httpconnectionManager.ttlSeconds=60
-Dmaven.wagon.rto=120000
